      "body": "I think I've seen similar tracebacks on 3.13 with PyO3 about interning strings. See [this line](https://gist.github.com/ngoldbaum/b01ea1cd3c6f39fbf2e68938b6489243#file-gistfile1-txt-L1044) in [the gist from this PyO3 issue](https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3/issues/4904).\n\nI want to re-do the TSAN PyO3 tests with 3.14, but I need to update the FFI definitions first. Generally PyO3 doesn't add support for new python versions until beta 1 to avoid dealing with churn.",
